Board-only suite: these trials pin an actor to core 1 and end the program from it with cast_exit (spec §15.1.2.5); they exist to exercise the ESP32-S3 runtime's cross-core exit wake, and they carry no .ascomp goldens for the hosted targets, so the host integrate run skips this directory. Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=ESP32-S3_raw TRIAL_SUITES=cast_exit_board_addition from trials/. Remove this file once hosted .ascomp goldens are added (the programs themselves are portable).
